// A nested case with a flat `press` beside it. The nested term already
// carries its steps in order, so this press has no step number to land on
// and would be appended somewhere the case never mentions: a fact that
// looks like it does something and does something else. Refused, loudly.
case( nested_mixed, "a nested case with a flat press beside it", [
    step( "F1", [ panel( "Help" ) ] )
] );
press( nested_mixed, 2, "Down" );
